,"cul":1,"persistent":false,"epmc_pair":0,"lift":0.62,"evidence_tier":"unstudied"},{"concept_id":"wounds","dsc":0,"cul":1,"persistent":false,"epmc_pair":0,"lift":0.61,"evidence_tier":"unstudied"}],"lead_score":null},"texts":{"cul:103-devils-bit":{"ref":"Culpeper, Complete Herbal: Devil’s-Bit","headword":"Devil’s-Bit","lang":"en","source":"culpeper","text":"The plant is venereal, pleasing, and harmless. The herb or the root (all that the devil hath left of it) being boiled in wine, and drank, is very powerful against the plague, and all pestilential diseases or fevers, poisons also, and the bitings of venemous beasts: It helps also those that are inwardly bruised by any casuality, or outwardly by falls or blows, dissolving the clotted blood; and the herb or root beaten and outwardly applied, takes away the black and blue marks that remain in the skin. The decoction of the herb, with honey of roses put therein, is very effectual to help the inveterate tumours and swellings of the almonds and throat, by often gargling the mouth therewith. It helps also to procure women’s courses, and eases all pains of the mother and to break and discuss wind therein, and in the bowels. The powder of the root taken in drink, drives forth the worms in the body. The juice or distilled water of the herb, is effectual for green wounds, or old sores, and cleanses the body inwardly, and the seed outwardly, from sores, scurf, itch, pimples, freckles, morphew, or other deformities thereof, especially if a little vitriol be dissolved therein.","spans":[{"start":167,"end":173,"concept_id":"plague","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":183,"end":195,"concept_id":"plague","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":208,"end":214,"concept_id":"fever","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":216,"end":223,"concept_id":"poisoning","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":238,"end":248,"concept_id":"envenomation","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":249,"end":257,"concept_id":"envenomation","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":286,"end":311,"concept_id":"bruises","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":346,"end":360,"concept_id":"bruises","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":377,"end":390,"concept_id":"bruises","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":458,"end":472,"concept_id":"bruises","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":634,"end":652,"concept_id":"sore_throat","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":710,"end":733,"concept_id":"amenorrhea","polarity":"action"},{"start":758,"end":768,"concept_id":"uterine_disorders","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":776,"end":798,"concept_id":"flatulence","polarity":"action"},{"start":883,"end":888,"concept_id":"helminthiasis","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":967,"end":973,"concept_id":"wounds","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":982,"end":987,"concept_id":"skin_ulcers","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":1050,"end":1055,"concept_id":"skin_ulcers","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":1057,"end":1062,"concept_id":"dermatitis","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":1064,"end":1068,"concept_id":"itch_scabies","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":1070,"end":1077,"concept_id":"skin_blemishes","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":1079,"end":1087,"concept_id":"skin_blemishes","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":1089,"end":1096,"concept_id":"skin_blemishes","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":1107,"end":1118,"concept_id":"skin_blemishes","polarity":"therapeutic"}]}},"gloss":{"cul:103-devils-bit":{"167":"plague","183":"pestilence, pestilential fevers / sores","208":"fevers","216":"resists / expels poison","238":"biting / stinging of (serpents, scorpions, beasts)","249":"venomous beasts / creatures","286":"those that are bruised","346":"hurts by falls or blows","377":"congealed / clotted blood (haematoma)","458":"black and blue marks / spots (ecchymosis)","634":"almonds of the throat: tonsils","710":"provokes / brings down the terms, courses: emmenagogue","758":"the mother: the womb (fits, rising, suffocation, pains of the mother)","776":"expels / breaks wind (carminative)","883":"worms (intestinal)","967":"wounds (green, fresh, inward, old); wound-herb","982":"sores, running sores","1050":"sores, running sores","1057":"scurf: scaling of the skin / scalp","1064":"itch, itches, itching","1070":"pimples","1079":"freckles","1089":"morphew: scurfy, discoloured skin","1107":"spots, blemishes, discolourings, deformities of the skin"}},"images":[]}